onPlayerCookingCallback(function(world, player, resultID, resultAmount, accuracy) end)
live
Fires when a player punches an oven and the dish resolves, whether it worked or not.

world
The world the oven is in.
player
The player who cooked.
resultID
Item id of the dish the recipe makes, even when the cook was ruined.
