onPlayerPunchPlayerCallback(function(world, attacker, victim) end)
live
PVP hit event, derived from a punch since the engine has no native one: fires when a punch lands on the tile another logged-in player is standing on. Costs nothing when no callback is registered.

onPlayerPunchPlayerCallback(function(world, attacker, victim)
    victim:onConsoleMessage("`4You were hit by " .. attacker:getCleanName())
